** The mathematics library: the specification module of the folder lib/math/. It re-exports `basic`, `explog`, `trig`, `numtheory` and `constants`, so `from lib use (math)` gives `math.sqrt`, `math.sin`, `math.pi`.
** @spec spec/library/math.md#rules-of-import-and-conversion  @feature F-LIB-03  @tests test/level1/a110_math_basic
module math is
  from basic export (*);
  from explog export (*);
  from trig export (*);
  from numtheory export (*);
  from constants export (*);
  from linear export (*);
  from random export (*);
  from rational export (*);
  from complex export (real_part, imag_part, modulus, argument, conjugate, from_polar, is_real);
  from linear export (*);
  from random export (*);
  from linear export (*);
  from random export (*);
end math;
